# Assault Drone (cast on turn 1 off a Swamp and three Moxen) is itself an artifact creature you control, so it is a 3/4, and
# your Ornithopter is a 1/2 (only the power rises). Bot2's own Ornithopter stays a 0/2 and a Mox (an artifact, not a creature)
# gets nothing. When Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Drone on turn two, the Ornithopter is a 0/2 again (CR 611.3b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Assault Drone
Ornithopter
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Ornithopter
Plains x4
Plains x10

